# REQUIRES: verilator
# HBM page streams (--page-engines): off-chip page columns (--storage
# <model>:pages=hbm) carried by shared engines instead of a controller per
# column. An engine is one virtual memory of one image (INSTANCES 1) whose
# rows are {column, instance, page}; each request is tagged {column,
# instance-and-page} (the instance port's top TAGW bits), the answer routed
# back by it. Columns of a copy move together, so each takes an engine of its
# own (a bank); a copy's page reads and writes are placed at positions of its
# windows free on its bank (reads after the frame before's write of the page,
# in page order, before the state pass; writes after it, before the copy's
# next state pass), so copies whose page traffic falls in other positions
# share a bank: the frame's static order multiplexes them, without FIFOs or
# arbiters. Against the target from zero state (tb_pages.sv: a model per
# virtual memory, answered 1 to 60 host cycles on, `free` low at times,
# PROTOCOL for a read of a tag outstanding or a write of one), at page 1 to
# 4, with copies, overlapped frames, nested sequencers, bubbles and stalls,
# and the leaves' RAM virtual too; two models sharing one engine
# (tb_linkhbm.sv, one image: rows of the shared memory, random power-up
# state), with HBM link streams beside them; the report; and a cap too small.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/paged
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/c2 --static --page 4 --storage Leaf:pages=hbm --copies Leaf:2 --zero-latency-links --zero-latency-chains --page-hbm-column-bits 64 --page-engines auto Leaf 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=C2
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=VH < %t/c2/foldsim_sim.vh
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -I%t/c2 -DVM1 -Mdir %t/c2/obj %S/Inputs/tb_pages.sv top.sv %t/c2/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/c2/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/c2/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +lo=1 +hi=30 +stall=30 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/c2/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +lo=1 +hi=60 +full=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/cols --static --page 1 --storage Leaf:pages=hbm --page-hbm-column-bits 64 --page-engines auto Leaf > %t/cols.log 2>&1
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -I%t/cols -DVM1 -DVM2 -Mdir %t/cols/obj %S/Inputs/tb_pages.sv top.sv %t/cols/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/cols/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/cols/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +lo=1 +hi=60 +stall=20 +full=20 | FileCheck %s
