# RUN: not foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/cap --static --page 1 --storage Leaf:pages=hbm --page-hbm-column-bits 64 --page-engines 2 Leaf 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CAP
# Two models sharing one engine, alone and beside link streams.
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/linkhbm
# The link streams on engines too (their requests and writes at positions,
# a member tag their landing slot or write tag), placed first, the pages
