# ODD: page engine 1 32 bits, tag 7, row 6: link:Unit>Reader
# C2: page engines: 2 engines, 2 page columns
# C2: page engine 0 64 bits, tag 4, row 5: Leaf:region1_pages
# C2: page engine 1 64 bits, tag 4, row 5: Leaf_copy1:region1_pages
# VH: `define FOLDSIM_VMEM_COUNT 2
# VH: `define FOLDSIM_VMEM_TAGS
# VH: `define FOLDSIM_VMEM_0_IW 5
# VH: `define FOLDSIM_VMEM_0_DW 64
# VH: `define FOLDSIM_VMEM_0_MW 8
# VH: `define FOLDSIM_VMEM_0_INSTANCES 1
# VH: `define FOLDSIM_VMEM_0_TAGW 4
# VH: `define FOLDSIM_VMEM_0_KNOWN_ZERO 0
# CAP: error: page engines: 2 engines cannot carry the page columns of Leaf (3 columns)
# TWO: page engines: 2 engines, 2 page columns
# TWO: page engine 0 32 bits, tag 8, row 7: Unit:region1_pages Reader:region1_pages link:Reader>Unit
# TWO: page engine 1 32 bits, tag 7, row 6: link:Unit>Reader
# IL: page engines: 1 engines, 2 page columns
# MIX: page engines: 2 engines, 2 page columns
# CHECK-NOT: PROTOCOL
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
